        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SPDP35S, Door Bolt Strike with Safety Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana made Dust Proof Solid Brass Door Bolt Strike with Safety Lock prevents the accumulation of debris in the bolt strike hole and adds more security to door bolts. The safety lock ensures that nothing can get stuck in the strike hole. Most often these are installed on the threshold of a surface mounted bolt or flush bolt in a store front or commercial door opening. It features an adjustable height with a plunger compression of 13/16 inches with a 5/8 inch radius. This strike includes matching finish screws. Available in 7 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SPDP35.gif?v=1704354594\" width=\"528\" height=\"201\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Dust Proof Door Bolt Strike With Safty LockSpecifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available : <a href=\"/products/dust-proof-solid-brass-door-bolt-strike-deltana-spdp278\"><b>Dust Proof Bolt Strike Without the Safety Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Strike Plate</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length - 3-1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Width - 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness - 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li> Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>Strike</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height  - 2-3/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Diameter - 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDimensions: <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SPDP35S.pdf?v=1704262210\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SPDP35S Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dust Proof Solid Brass Door Bolt Strike with Safety Lock SPDP35S",
                "description": "Door Bolt Strike with Safety Lock Deltana SPDP35S - The Deltana made Dust Proof Solid Brass Door Bolt Strike with Safety Lock prevents the accumulation of debris in the bolt strike hole and adds more security to door bolts. The safety lock ensures that nothing can get stuck in the strike hole. Most often these are installed on the threshold of a surface mounted bolt or flush bolt in a store front or commercial door opening. It features an adjustable height with a plunger compression of 13/16 inches with a 5/8 inch radius. This strike includes matching finish screws. Available in 7 different finishes.\r\n",
